 "keywords": ["animal", "scary", "horror", "flight", "hangout"], "long_description": "Bird Things is a FREE multiplayer social VR game on Meta Quest.  \n\n**Grow your own army of pet warrior birds, train them for war, level them up, then hunt humans, mutants and bosses. Protect your nest and bring glory to birds!**\n\nJoin the Bird Things Discord -> [discord.gg/hUFTDtQgZk]                                                                                \n   \n{1508484180723902}  \n\nContent:   \n**\ud83d\udc24 21 pet warrior birds** to collect   \n\u2b06\ufe0f **4 super-scary bosses** to fight  \n\ud83d\udc51 **Level up** each pet bird up from **0 - 1,000,000**  \n\u2b50 **Climb 25 ranks** in the Bird Army from **Private \u2192 General**\n\n\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f **27 army medals to get** for elite performance on the battlefield  \n\ud83e\uddea **7 potions to craft** - each giving you a special power  \n\ud83d\udd12 Busy lobbies, **private servers + safe zones**  \n  ", "short_description": "Join the Bird Army in this chaotic multiplayer VR adventure!\n \nGrow your own army of pet birds, train them for war, collect them all, and level them up.\n\nBattle mankind in terrifying dungeons, harvest limbs, and survive scary mutated foes. Earn Bottlecaps, craft secret Powerups, and dominate the battlefield.\n \nNew content like bosses, dungeons, and cosmetics every two weeks. Customize your bird, rise through the ranks, and prove you\u2019re the top bird in this darkly funny, scary, filled world!"}]}, "developer_name": "SUPER HYPER MEGA", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://superhypermega.studio/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SUPER HYPER MEGA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://superhypermega.studio/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "4