ntent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825050_825882973531709_8260837350204629451_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jeZocBcCQlcQ7kNvwH6NpdH&_nc_oc=AdpD2yh_RqTVCu3RFICuz8g-4tb3JuUtiK0Sk7R_7btO7tG6fy-yGjLn0ZJ6vEQXkjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIs1NpGPF8lG98_STlJ9RYnS5Lv5N_aKJAutrnNa8Uc7A&oe=6AA01BA2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "2025576408197740", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_2025576418197739_1896078628805356251_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DwhndrrVQFMQ7kNvwFr8s3B&_nc_oc=AdqAg6Le5_NNNLH5xypQuxGIEZF9Lsr46DzOsuf6O1lDLPUBRW5F-FO6NbUF-Rk_hxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKypwNSxcwgKX7IaN9xRkHI06SQwNhI-_yPMTc_gB_OnQ&oe=6AA00E7E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "1200884108561973", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1200884111895306_7745564696190344625_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6vs5G4YRXTEQ7kNvwHfQbdd&_nc_oc=AdoCwOZHH80DVEFY-iS0TCoEQi1dUctH6IoxrRqv40JSfigcG16SU6uFnZ4tDbld-sg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLXki3CJbjjSO4zIAspX5VdD98w1VrYhXo3nTaU9lLkRA&oe=6AA0164B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1532802167916900", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822723_1532802171250233_1682952111814488886_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LAxHrOxhJXgQ7kNvwGT5b5J&_nc_oc=AdpYwCiDmVFCfPNAFs4YV2lV6hyUfK0J9VXw6XtDr2vz0Wy6LwFcY7g9ISHxIDTsMig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZZd_AfFbHQYVY3z4ehiSoJd6Zmi260rSe0dSTxAh_vA&oe=6AA0268A"}, "display_name": "Bird Things", "keywords": ["animal", "scary", "horror", "flight", "hangout"], "long_description": "[Bird Things is in Early Access - expect bugs and other weird things as the game develops]\n\n# Join the Bird Army in its epic fight with mankind!\n \nBattle to survive in this chaotic multiplayer VR adventure. Earn Bottlecaps by harvesting NPC limbs or by winning frantic mini-games. Use Bottlecaps to buy Powerups and level up your Bird to get the edge. Weekly content drops mean no two battles are the same!\n \n{25178754785121791}\n \n**Level Up**\n \nCollect Bottlecaps to spend on crafting materials. Work out secret crafting patterns to unlock special Powerups to help you rule over the battlefield. Fight the evil armies of men back into their dungeons... but beware of weird mutated men and their rulers that lurk in the depths of the dungeons! \n \n{1294600642335383}\n \n**Compete and Win**\n \nPlay three fast-paced mini-games: Ring Racer, Baby Chaser, and Death Match. Prove you're the top bird and win Bottlecaps to spend on upgrades.\n  \n{1163764552006998}\n \n**Weekly Content Drops**\n \nUpdates every week. More dungeons, more powerups, more cosmetics, more bosses! What more do you want? Tell us on our Discord and we'll add it! Discord.gg/BirdThings\n \n{1908262703137313}\n \n**Make Your Bird REALLY GOOD**\n \nCustomize your bird by picking skin colours and expressions. Look out for updates with more skins, outfits, and hats to help you stand out.\n \n{846010747816251}\n \nJoin fellow Birds in the Bird Things Discord for updates, challenges, giveaways and sneak peeks! Discord.gg/BirdThings", "short_description": "Join the Bird Army in this chaotic multiplayer VR adventure!\n \nBattle mankind in terrifying dungeons, harvest limbs, and survive scary mutated foes. Earn Bottlecaps by winning frantic mini-games, craft secret Powerups, and dominate the battlefield.\n \nWith weekly content drops - new bosses, dungeons, and cosmetics - no two fights are the same. Customize your bird, rise through the ranks, and prove you\u2019re the top bird in this darkly funny, scary, filled world!"}]}, "developer_name": "SUPER HYPER MEGA", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://superhypermega.studio/privacy.html", "developer_te